# Line endings: every text file is stored and checked out with LF, on every OS, so the
# generated ui/shared/ copies stay byte-identical to their sources (the "Checks" workflow
# compares them exactly) and diffs don't fill up with line-ending changes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touched.
*.png binary
*.pem binary
*.crx binary
*.zip binary
